# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Combine measurement tables for plots and gates"
msgstr "合并测量表以用于绘图和门控"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Open **Graph Builder** or **Gate Editor** from Home to explore measurements. Both screens offer **Merge tables** immediately beside the table picker. The same merge definition produces the same measurements in either screen. For the surrounding workflow, see :doc:`workflows`."
msgstr "从 Home 打开 **Graph Builder** 或 **Gate Editor**，以探索测量结果。两个界面都在表选择器旁提供 **合并表格**。同一合并定义在两个界面中生成相同的测量值。相关整体工作流程见 :doc:`workflows`。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Choose a source and an observation level"
msgstr "选择数据源和观察层级"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "**Load table** opens a SQLite measurement database or a CSV/TSV table. A physical table is an existing table in that database. A derived table is a named result calculated from physical tables using a saved merge definition. Creating a derived table preserves the original measurement tables."
msgstr "**Load table** 打开 SQLite 测量数据库或 CSV/TSV 表。物理表是数据库中已经存在的表。派生表是使用已保存的合并定义，从物理表计算出的命名结果。创建派生表会保留原始测量表。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Merging requires one SQLite database. The button is unavailable for a single CSV/TSV or a Gate Editor session combining several databases. Load the one database containing the tables you want to join."
msgstr "合并需要一个 SQLite 数据库。对于单个 CSV/TSV，或同时组合多个数据库的 Gate Editor 会话，该按钮不可用。请加载包含所有待连接表的那个数据库。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "In Graph Builder, choosing a table changes the chart's source. Gate Editor also supports a working set of compatible physical object tables, shown as removable chips; selecting another compatible table adds its measurements. The last remaining chip stays in place so the editor always has a source. A named derived table is selected as a complete source. Use the merge popup when you need a named, reproducible result or explicit custom relationships."
msgstr "在 Graph Builder 中，选择表会改变图表的数据源。Gate Editor 还支持由兼容物理对象表组成的工作集，并将其显示为可移除的标签；选择另一个兼容表会加入其测量数据。最后一个标签不能移除，从而确保编辑器始终有数据源。命名派生表会作为一个完整数据源被选中。需要命名、可重现的结果或明确的自定义关系时，请使用合并对话框。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "The **Output observation table** determines what one result row represents. For example, a cell-level result has one row per cell even when that cell contains several pathogens. A nucleus count, total pathogen area and cell intensity can then be compared on the same row."
msgstr "**输出观测表** 决定每个结果行表示什么。例如，细胞层级的结果中每个细胞占一行，即使该细胞含有多个病原体。这样就可以在同一行比较细胞核数量、病原体总面积和细胞强度。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Create a standard spaCR merge"
msgstr "创建标准 spaCR 合并"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Load your measurement database and press **Merge tables**."
msgstr "加载测量数据库并按 **合并表格**。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Tick the source tables and choose **Output observation table**. The base table is included automatically. Standard merges use compatible spaCR object tables and cell/cytoplasm observation levels; the list also shows other tables whose relationships may require customization."
msgstr "勾选源表并选择 **输出观测表**。基础表会自动包含在内。标准合并使用兼容的 spaCR 对象表及细胞／细胞质观察层级；列表也显示其他表，这些表的关系可能需要自定义。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Enter a **Result name**, such as ``Cell and pathogen measurements``. It must differ from every physical table name."
msgstr "输入 **结果名称**，例如 ``Cell and pathogen measurements``。该名称必须不同于所有物理表的名称。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Review the **spaCR defaults active** summary and the per-column **Aggregation** choices. For an ordinary compatible database, no manual key mapping is needed."
msgstr "检查 **spaCR defaults active** 摘要，以及每列的 **聚合** 选项。对于普通的兼容数据库，无需手动映射键。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Press **Validate and preview**. Inspect the input and output row counts, join keys, unmatched records, missing child keys, repeated child-key rows and the first 12 output rows. Validation examines the full input, even though only a few result rows are displayed."
msgstr "按 **验证和预览**。检查输入和输出行数、连接键、未匹配记录、缺失的子表键、子表键重复的行，以及前 12 个输出行。验证会检查全部输入，即使只显示少量结果行。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Press **Create merged table** after validation succeeds. The result is selected in the normal table picker. Its columns are available for charts and gates."
msgstr "验证成功后按 **创建合并表**。结果会在普通表选择器中被选中，其列可用于图表和门控。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Changing a table, name or rule invalidates the preview. Validate again before creating the result. Selecting a different table or base also resets custom relationships and overrides, so choose your sources before customizing them."
msgstr "更改表、名称或规则后，预览会失效。创建结果前请重新验证。选择不同的表或基础表还会重置自定义关系和覆盖设置，因此应先选定数据源，再进行自定义。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "How the defaults combine measurements"
msgstr "默认规则如何组合测量值"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "The shared spaCR rules aggregate each child table independently before joining it to the base observations. Adding both pathogens and organelles does not multiply their rows together. Identity includes the available plate, well, field and time metadata together with the relevant object/parent ID; an object number alone is not a globally unique identity."
msgstr "spaCR 的共享规则先独立聚合每个子表，再将其连接到基础观察记录。同时添加病原体和细胞器时，不会将两者的行相互相乘。身份信息包括可用的板、孔、视野和时间元数据，以及相关对象／父对象 ID；单独一个对象编号并不是全局唯一身份。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Default aggregation for child measurements"
msgstr "子表测量值的默认聚合"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Measurement"
msgstr "测量项"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Rule"
msgstr "规则"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Area, integrated/total intensity and counts"
msgstr "面积、积分／总强度及计数"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Sum the child values."
msgstr "对子表值求和。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Minimum intensity"
msgstr "最小强度"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Retain the minimum child value."
msgstr "保留最小的子表值。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Maximum intensity"
msgstr "最大强度"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Retain the maximum child value."
msgstr "保留最大的子表值。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Median measurements"
msgstr "中位数测量项"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Take the median of the child measurements."
msgstr "取子表测量值的中位数。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Other numeric measurements, including means"
msgstr "其他数值测量项，包括均值"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Take the mean of the child measurements."
msgstr "取子表测量值的平均值。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Text and identifiers"
msgstr "文本和标识符"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Retain the first nonmissing value in source order by default; identifiers cannot be averaged or summed."
msgstr "默认按源数据顺序保留第一个非缺失值；标识符不能求平均或求和。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "For four pathogens with areas 1, 2, 4 and 8, total pathogen area is 15. A mean intensity is the mean of the four object measurements, not an intensity recalculated from all their pooled pixels. Inspect the rule shown for each column when its name does not describe its measurement convention."
msgstr "对于面积分别为 1、2、4、8 的四个病原体，总病原体面积为 15。平均强度是这四个对象测量值的平均值，而不是从它们的全部合并像素重新计算的强度。如果列名没有说明测量约定，请检查该列显示的规则。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "The default nucleus join retains only matching base observations. Pathogen and organelle joins retain uninfected cells. Missing measurements remain missing, including a sum for which every contributing value is missing. An absent intensity measurement is not converted to a measured zero. Child columns use table-qualified names where needed to distinguish them."
msgstr "默认的细胞核连接只保留匹配的基础观察记录。病原体和细胞器连接会保留未感染细胞。缺失测量值仍然缺失，包括所有参与值都缺失的求和结果。缺失的强度测量不会被转换为实际测得的零。必要时，子表列名会包含表名以便区分。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Available overrides depend on column values and role. Numeric measurements offer mean, median, sum, minimum, maximum, count and other compatible choices; text supports choices such as first/last, count and distinct count; Boolean-valued data also support **any** and **all**. **count** counts nonmissing values. Default one-to-one rows attach intact, so their aggregation controls are disabled until custom merging is selected."
msgstr "可用的覆盖选项取决于列值和列的角色。数值测量支持均值、中位数、求和、最小值、最大值、计数等兼容选项；文本支持首个／最后一个值、计数和去重计数等选项；布尔数据还支持 **任何** 和 **all**。**count** 统计非缺失值。默认的一对一行会完整附加，因此在选择自定义合并之前，其聚合控件处于禁用状态。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Customize an alternative schema"
msgstr "自定义其他表结构"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Choose **Customize merging** when the database uses different table names, identifiers or deliberately different relationships. Choose the base and child tables in the main popup first. Mapping their actual columns does not rename or modify the source tables."
msgstr "当数据库使用不同的表名、标识符或有意采用不同关系时，选择 **定制合并**。先在主对话框中选择基础表和子表。映射实际列不会重命名或修改源表。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "The warning explains that incorrect relationships can link unrelated objects, duplicate or omit observations, and change measurements used in plots and gates. Read it and check **I understand the warning and will check the merge preview.** before accepting the custom settings. Acknowledgment does not bypass validation."
msgstr "警告说明，错误的关系可能连接无关对象、重复或遗漏观察记录，并改变绘图和门控所使用的测量值。请阅读警告，并在接受自定义设置前勾选 **我理解警告,我会检查合并预览。**。确认警告并不意味着跳过验证。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "**Base observation keys** identify one unique, nonmissing base row. Include field and time columns when IDs repeat across images or timepoints."
msgstr "**基表观测键** 标识唯一且键值不缺失的基础行。如果 ID 在不同图像或时间点重复，请包含视野和时间列。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Each child row in the configuration specifies **Base keys** and **Child keys**. Enter comma-separated column names in matching order. For example, base ``image_id, cell_id`` can map to child ``image_id, parent_cell_id``."
msgstr "配置中的每个子表行都指定 **基表键** 和 **子表键**。以对应顺序输入逗号分隔的列名。例如，基础表的 ``image_id, cell_id`` 可以映射到子表的 ``image_id, parent_cell_id``。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Choose **one-to-one** when at most one child row belongs to each base key, or **one-to-many** when several child rows must first be aggregated."
msgstr "每个基础键最多对应一个子表行时，选择 **one-to-one**；需要先聚合多个子表行时，选择 **one-to-many**。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "A **left** join keeps unmatched base observations with missing child measurements. An **inner** join retains only matching observations. Child rows with missing join keys do not match a base row."
msgstr "**左侧** 连接保留未匹配的基础观察记录，并将其子表测量值留为缺失。**inner** 连接只保留匹配的观察记录。连接键缺失的子表行不会匹配任何基础行。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Use **Identifiers** to identify additional child columns that must not be treated as continuous measurements. Review the per-column aggregation controls in the main popup after accepting the mapping."
msgstr "使用 **标识符** 标记其他不应被视为连续测量值的子表列。接受映射后，请在主对话框中检查各列的聚合控件。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "The popup now says **Custom rules active**. Validate and inspect the preview before creating the result. Duplicate base identities, contradictory one-to-one mappings, missing keys and incompatible operations produce an error. Repeated child keys can be expected in a one-to-many relationship; they require investigation when the relationship is supposed to be one-to-one."
msgstr "对话框现在显示 **Custom rules active**。创建结果前请验证并检查预览。重复的基础身份、矛盾的一对一映射、缺失键和不兼容操作都会产生错误。在一对多关系中，子表键重复可能是正常的；如果关系本应为一对一，则需要调查。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "**Cancel** leaves the previous configuration intact. **Reset to spaCR defaults** removes custom relationships and overrides. Changing sources or the output table also rebuilds the defaults."
msgstr "**取消** 保留原有配置。**恢复 spaCR 默认设置** 删除自定义关系和覆盖设置。更改数据源或输出表也会重新建立默认设置。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Use, save and reload the result"
msgstr "使用、保存并重新加载结果"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "In Graph Builder, place result columns on **X**, **Y**, colour, size or facet channels. In Gate Editor, use the columns for thresholds, polygons and other gate shapes. The Gate Editor may display a sample according to its ``sample_fraction`` and ``max_points`` settings; gate export evaluates the full merged table."
msgstr "在 Graph Builder 中，将结果列放到 **X**、**Y**、颜色、大小或分面通道。在 Gate Editor 中，将这些列用于阈值、多边形和其他门控形状。Gate Editor 可能根据 ``sample_fraction`` 和 ``max_points`` 设置显示抽样数据；导出门控时会计算完整的合并表。"

msgid "When a Graph Builder channel is cleared, or holds a column the chosen plot kind cannot draw, the canvas explains what is missing instead of drawing a chart. For example, it asks you to drag a column onto **X** or **Y**, says that a histogram needs a continuous column, or names a column that the current table does not contain. The plot kind stays selected, so placing suitable columns draws the chart again."
msgstr "当 Graph Builder 的某个通道被清空，或其中的列无法用所选图表类型绘制时，画布不会绘制图表，而是说明缺少什么。例如，它会提示你将一列拖到 **X** 或 **Y** 上，说明直方图需要连续型列，或指出当前表中不存在的某个列。图表类型保持选中，因此放入合适的列后图表会重新绘制。"

msgid "Gate Editor in three dimensions"
msgstr "三维 Gate Editor"

msgid "Choose **3D** in Gate Editor and pick a third measurement for **Z**. Drag with the right mouse button to orbit the volume: the view keeps the angle you leave it at and does not snap back to an axis. The mouse wheel zooms about the pointer, and points outside the zoomed box are hidden."
msgstr "在 Gate Editor 中选择 **3D** ，并为 **Z** 选择第三个测量值。按住鼠标右键拖动可环绕旋转体积：视图会保持你停下时的角度，不会弹回某个坐标轴。鼠标滚轮以指针为中心缩放，缩放框之外的点会被隐藏。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "In **Draw** mode, the shape dropdown lists the gates you can draw in 3D:"
msgstr "在 **绘制** 模式下，形状下拉菜单列出可在 3D 中绘制的门："

msgid "**Polygon through view**: click the corners on screen, then click the first corner again or double-click to close the outline. The gate keeps every object whose position in the current view falls inside the outline, through the whole depth of the volume. **Lasso through view** and **Rectangle through view** select through the depth in the same way; drag to draw them."
msgstr "**穿过视图的多边形** ：在屏幕上点击各个角点，然后再次点击第一个角点或双击以闭合轮廓。该门保留在当前视图中位置落在轮廓内的所有对象，贯穿整个体积的深度。 **穿过视图的套索** 和 **穿过视图的矩形** 以相同方式贯穿深度进行选择；拖动即可绘制。"

msgid "**Ellipsoid with handles** and **Box with handles**: drag a rectangle over a population and the shape is fitted to the objects it frames. Pull a face or radius handle to resize it, or drag the centre handle to move it. Gates drawn through the view also move by their centre handle."
msgstr "**带控制柄的椭球体** 和 **带控制柄的长方体** ：在一个群体上拖出一个矩形，形状会拟合其所框住的对象。拖动面或半径控制柄可调整大小，拖动中心控制柄可移动它。贯穿视图绘制的门也可通过其中心控制柄移动。"

msgid "While you draw or adjust a shape, the objects inside it are highlighted. Double-click a gate's name in the gate table to rename it; gates built from it follow the new name. Gates drawn in 3D are saved, loaded and exported like 2D gates, with the same membership columns."
msgstr "在绘制或调整形状时，其中的对象会被高亮显示。在门表中双击门的名称即可重命名；由它构建的门会随之使用新名称。在 3D 中绘制的门与 2D 门一样保存、加载和导出，并具有相同的成员列。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "The named definition is stored beside its database. For ``measurements.db``, the file is ``measurements.db.spacr-merges.json``. Refreshing or reopening the source makes the result available again and recalculates it from the source. This is a reproducible recipe, not a frozen copy of all result rows. Reuse checks the source path and selected tables' schemas. A different database or changed schema requires a newly reviewed mapping; definitions are not silently applied to unrelated sources."
msgstr "命名定义保存在数据库旁边。对于 ``measurements.db``，文件名为 ``measurements.db.spacr-merges.json``。刷新或重新打开数据源后，该结果再次可用，并根据数据源重新计算。这是一个可重现的配方，不是全部结果行的固定副本。重新使用时会检查源路径和所选表的结构。不同数据库或结构变化需要重新审查映射；定义不会静默应用于无关数据源。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "**Save chart** in Graph Builder saves chart channels, the source and the full merge definition to JSON. **Load chart** reconstructs and validates the table before plotting. **Save gates…** also embeds the merge definition; load the original database before using **Load gates…**. These saved files can reconstruct the merge even if its sidecar is missing. They still require the original source data."
msgstr "Graph Builder 中的 **保存图** 将图表通道、数据源和完整合并定义保存为 JSON。**加载图** 会在绘图前重建并验证表。**保存门控区域…** 也会嵌入合并定义；使用 **加载门控区域…** 前应先加载原始数据库。即使合并的旁存文件缺失，这些保存文件仍可重建合并。但它们仍然需要原始源数据。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "**Export gates…** writes gate membership columns to the database's ``filters`` table, preserving the base object's identity. This explicit export is a database write; constructing and previewing a merge does not write into the source measurement tables. **Save graph** exports the Gate Editor figure as PNG or PDF, separately from saving its gating strategy."
msgstr "**导出门控…** 将门控成员关系列写入数据库的 ``filters`` 表，并保留基础对象身份。这种显式导出会写入数据库；创建和预览合并不会写入源测量表。**保存图表** 将 Gate Editor 图形导出为 PNG 或 PDF，与保存门控策略是两件独立的事。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "A custom result without verified spaCR image/object provenance remains usable for plotting and tabular gating. Image navigation, image annotation and gate export to the measurement database are unavailable for that result, with an explanation in the interface. Keep the saved chart or gating strategy for tabular reuse; column names alone cannot establish links to microscopy objects."
msgstr "缺少已验证 spaCR 图像／对象来源信息的自定义结果，仍可用于绘图和表格门控。该结果不能用于图像导航、图像标注或将门控导出到测量数据库，界面会说明原因。保留已保存的图表或门控策略，以便在表格层面重用；仅凭列名无法建立到显微图像对象的联系。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Recover original filenames before labelling conditions"
msgstr "标注条件前恢复原始文件名"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "If images were renamed to Yokogawa format, use **Merge original filenames…** inside **Merge tables** to recover the names recorded during conversion. Select ``conversion_map.csv``, a legacy ``rename_log.csv``, a ``channel_sorting_manifest.csv``, or a SQLite database containing the ``conversion_map`` table. The file picker starts near a known mapping when one is found beside the measurement database or in its parent folders. The mapping must contain recorded source-to-output relationships; this action does not infer treatment names from renamed images."
msgstr "如果图像已重命名为 Yokogawa 格式，请在 **合并原始文件名…** 中使用 **合并表格**，恢复转换时记录的名称。选择 ``conversion_map.csv``、旧版 ``rename_log.csv``、``channel_sorting_manifest.csv``，或包含 ``conversion_map`` 表的 SQLite 数据库。如果在测量数据库旁或其父文件夹找到已知映射，文件选择器会从其附近打开。映射必须包含已记录的源文件到输出文件的关系；此操作不会根据重命名后的图像推断处理条件名称。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "For filename metadata alone, select just the table you want to annotate. This retains every row and existing column, including tables without spaCR object IDs. For an existing merged result, open its merge popup to preserve the reviewed relationships and aggregation while adding the filename mapping. With several source tables selected, measurements are merged first and the original names are attached to the resulting observations."
msgstr "如果只需要文件名元数据，只选择要标注的那个表。这样会保留所有行和现有列，也适用于没有 spaCR 对象 ID 的表。对于已有的合并结果，打开其合并对话框，可在添加文件名映射时保留已审查的关系和聚合设置。选择多个源表时，先合并测量值，再将原始名称附加到结果观察记录。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Press **Merge original filenames…** and select the mapping."
msgstr "按 **合并原始文件名…** 并选择映射。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Set a new **Result name**, then press **Validate and preview**."
msgstr "设置新的 **结果名称**，然后按 **验证和预览**。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Inspect the matched and unmatched row counts and the preview's ``original_filename`` and ``original_path`` columns."
msgstr "检查匹配和未匹配的行数，以及预览中的 ``original_filename`` 和 ``original_path`` 列。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Press **Create merged table**, then open **Annotate conditions** and choose ``original_filename`` as a rule's metadata column."
msgstr "按 **创建合并表**，然后打开 **标注实验条件**，选择 ``original_filename`` 作为某条规则的元数据列。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Several channels or z-planes belonging to one field produce a sorted, deduplicated list separated by a semicolon and a space in the new columns. They do not multiply the table's observations. Plate and timepoint identities remain distinct; ambiguous or conflicting identities cause validation to fail. Unmatched names remain blank. Existing ``original_filename`` or ``original_path`` columns are preserved by refusing to overwrite them."
msgstr "同一视野的多个通道或 z 层会在新列中形成排序、去重的列表，用分号和空格分隔。它们不会增加表中观察记录的数量。不同板和时间点的身份仍然分开；身份含糊或冲突会导致验证失败。未匹配名称保持为空。已有的 ``original_filename`` 或 ``original_path`` 列会通过拒绝覆盖而得到保留。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "``original_path`` is the path recorded in the mapping; the original files need not still exist at that location. Image files and source measurement tables are never renamed or rewritten by this action. Adding filename text does not establish missing microscopy object provenance."
msgstr "``original_path`` 是映射中记录的路径；原始文件不必仍位于该位置。此操作从不重命名或重写图像文件和源测量表。添加文件名文本不能补足缺失的显微对象来源信息。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "The saved merge records the mapping's location and a content checksum. Reopening a merge or chart requires that mapping to remain available and unchanged. For an embedded ``conversion_map`` table, unrelated changes to other database tables do not invalidate the mapping. If the mapping changes, select it again and validate a new result before applying it. **Remove filename mapping** removes the enrichment from the draft without deleting the file. **Reset to spaCR defaults** also clears the mapping."
msgstr "保存的合并会记录映射的位置和内容校验和。重新打开合并或图表时，映射必须仍然可用且未发生变化。对于嵌入的 ``conversion_map`` 表，对数据库其他表进行无关修改不会使映射失效。如果映射改变，请重新选择并验证新的结果后再应用。**移除文件名映射** 从草稿中移除文件名补充信息，而不删除文件。**恢复 spaCR 默认设置** 也会清除映射。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Annotate experimental conditions in Graph Builder"
msgstr "在 Graph Builder 中标注实验条件"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "**Annotate conditions** adds annotation columns to the working table in Graph Builder. It works with a physical database table, a named derived table or an imported CSV/TSV. Use rules to assign labels or extract variable metadata, then compose a final column from those values. Every generated column is retained. These table operations do not require image links or write image annotations."
msgstr "**标注实验条件** 在 Graph Builder 的工作表中添加标注列。它适用于物理数据库表、命名派生表或导入的 CSV/TSV。使用规则分配标签或提取可变元数据，再根据这些值组合最终列。每个生成列都会保留。这些表操作不需要图像链接，也不会写入图像标注。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Open **Annotate conditions**, name the **Output column**, and choose **Assign values**, **Extract text**, or **Compose column**. Existing source columns cannot be replaced."
msgstr "打开 **标注实验条件**，为 **输出列** 命名，然后选择 **分配值**、**提取文本** 或 **组合列**。不能替换已有的源列。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Define the value rules, text extraction, or composition for that output. Use **Add column** for another output. A named-group regex can also create several metadata columns together."
msgstr "为该输出定义值规则、文本提取或组合方式。使用 **添加列** 添加另一个输出。带命名组的正则表达式还可以一次创建多个元数据列。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
