# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Resolve invalid rules, missing dependencies and conflicting assignments, then choose **Apply conditions**. Every generated column becomes available for chart channels and filtering. **Cancel** discards the draft changes."
msgstr "解决无效规则、缺失依赖和分配冲突后，选择 **应用条件**。所有生成列都可用于图表通道和筛选。**取消** 放弃草稿中的修改。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Extract several metadata columns from a filename"
msgstr "从文件名提取多个元数据列"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Choose **Extract text** and select the source column, such as ``original_filename``. A regular expression extracts the matching text into the output column. Select a named or numbered capture group to choose which part of the match becomes the value."
msgstr "选择 **提取文本**，再选择源列，例如 ``original_filename``。正则表达式将匹配文本提取到输出列。选择命名或编号捕获组，以决定将匹配内容的哪一部分作为值。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "For example, this pattern describes ``HeLa_rep2_24h_DMSO.tif``:"
msgstr "例如，以下模式描述 ``HeLa_rep2_24h_DMSO.tif``："

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "The named groups describe four output columns: ``cell_type``, ``replicate``, ``timepoint`` and ``drug``. **Create columns from named groups** creates these outputs together. The example row produces ``HeLa``, ``rep2``, ``24h`` and ``DMSO``. Another matching filename produces its own values; they are not fixed labels copied from the example. Adapt the pattern to your own filenames and inspect the preview before applying it."
msgstr "命名组描述四个输出列：``cell_type``、``replicate``、``timepoint`` 和 ``drug``。**根据命名捕获组创建列** 会一起创建这些输出。示例行生成 ``HeLa``、``rep2``、``24h`` 和 ``DMSO``。另一个匹配文件名会生成其自身的值，而不是复制示例中的固定标签。请根据自己的文件名调整模式，并在应用前检查预览。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Extraction uses the first regex match. Nonmatching rows and missing or empty captures remain blank. Invalid patterns or capture groups stop the preview with an error. Existing source column names cannot be overwritten."
msgstr "提取使用第一个正则匹配。未匹配行，以及缺失或为空的捕获结果，均保持为空。无效模式或捕获组会导致预览停止并报错。不能覆盖现有源列名称。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Assign values with readable rules"
msgstr "通过易读规则分配值"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Choose **Assign values** when matching rows should receive a value you type, such as ``WildType`` or ``control``. Each rule selects a column, an operator and a comparison value. Operators include contains, does not contain, equals, does not equal, starts with, ends with and regex matching. Text operators interpret punctuation literally; regex operators interpret it as a pattern. Matching is case-sensitive. Contains, prefix, suffix and regex criteria need nonempty text. Use an explicit ``.*`` regex to match all nonmissing text, or equals with an empty value to match an actual empty string."
msgstr "如果匹配行应获得您输入的某个值，例如 ``WildType`` 或 ``control``，请选择 **分配值**。每条规则选择列、运算符和比较值。运算符包括包含、不包含、等于、不等于、开头为、结尾为以及正则匹配。文本运算符按字面解释标点；正则运算符将其解释为模式。匹配区分大小写。包含、前缀、后缀和正则条件需要非空文本。要匹配所有非缺失文本，请明确使用 ``.*`` 正则；要匹配实际的空字符串，请使用等于运算符并将比较值留空。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Choose **all rules match** when every criterion must match, or **any rule matches** when at least one must match. Criteria may inspect different source columns or earlier generated columns. For example, assign ``control`` when ``drug`` equals ``DMSO`` and ``cell_type`` equals ``HeLa``. Missing source values do not satisfy a negative criterion. An actual empty string is a value and can be matched explicitly."
msgstr "要求每个条件都匹配时，选择 **所有规则均匹配**；要求至少一个条件匹配时，选择 **至少一条规则匹配**。条件可以检查不同源列或先前生成的列。例如，当 ``drug`` 等于 ``DMSO`` 且 ``cell_type`` 等于 ``HeLa`` 时，分配 ``control``。缺失源值不会满足否定条件。实际空字符串属于一个值，可以显式匹配。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Several rules may assign the same value without a conflict. Different values assigned to one row in the same output column require resolution before Apply."
msgstr "多条规则可以分配相同值而不产生冲突。在同一输出列中，如果同一行被分配不同值，则必须在应用前解决冲突。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Compose the final column"
msgstr "组合最终列"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Add an output column, name it ``condition`` or another name you choose, and select **Compose column**. Drag available columns into the composition field. Drag its tokens to change their order. Insert fixed text to add separators, prefixes or words between the values."
msgstr "添加输出列，将其命名为 ``condition`` 或自选名称，并选择 **组合列**。将可用列拖入组合字段。拖动其中的标记可以更改顺序。插入固定文本可在值之间添加分隔符、前缀或词语。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "For example, the tokens ``cell_type``, ``_``, ``replicate``, ``_``, ``timepoint``, ``_``, ``drug`` produce ``HeLa_rep2_24h_DMSO`` for the example above. Reordering the column tokens changes the result without changing their extraction rules. Fixed text is literal; it cannot execute code."
msgstr "例如，标记 ``cell_type``、``_``、``replicate``、``_``、``timepoint``、``_``、``drug`` 会为上面的示例生成 ``HeLa_rep2_24h_DMSO``。重新排列列标记会改变结果，而不改变其提取规则。固定文本仅按字面处理，不能执行代码。"

# AI technical review (Codex), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "A composition can reference original source columns and earlier generated columns. A missing or empty column value leaves the composed value blank. The preview shows all intermediate columns and the final column together. Applying, exporting or saving a new SQLite table retains every generated column and the editable recipe. The original measurements remain unchanged."
msgstr "组合可以引用原始源列和先前生成的列。列值缺失或为空时，组合结果保持为空。预览会同时显示所有中间列和最终列。应用、导出或保存为新 SQLite 表时，都会保留每个生成列及可编辑配方。原始测量值保持不变。"

